          },
          "body": "## Summary\n- Redact 64-hex ledger ids from TUI paint, `--once`, and detach so casts can pass `TOKEN_IN_CAST`.\n- After a v2 HTTP admit, spawn the real `bullet-runner` with a signed-in stub, retain failure, and refuse a second spawn. No `--provider sim`.\n- Codex argv can emit a `PatchProposal`; Cursor without one is `CURSOR_ACP_EVENTS_EMPTY`. ACP `_meta` stays unproved (Fork B).\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cargo test -p bullet --test operator_tui`\n- [x] `cargo test -p bullet-runner --bin bullet-runner stub_stdout_proposal`\n- [x] `cargo test -p bullet-farmd --test coding_tasks v2_http_then_real_runner`\n- [ ] Hosted `CI / required` on this PR\n- [ ] Root merge after Hub #11/#12 and Kernel #15/#16\n\nStacked on #16. This lane does not merge.\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
